        defendant: [.direct("Please tell us about your spouse.", "\"{V} and I were expecting our child. We had planned and prepared for months. I loved {V} and I was devastated by the disappearance.\""), .direct("What happened the night of the fundraiser?", "\"{V} walked to the mailbox and did not come back. I looked outside and could not find {V}, and I called the sheriff.\""), .direct("Why did you double the life insurance?", "\"Because we were about to have a child. Many parents do. It had nothing to do with {V}'s disappearance.\""), .direct("Why did you search pond depth?", "\"For a project on my uncle's land. I did not think about it after, and I know the timing looks terrible.\""), .direct("Why was your truck on the farm lane at 4 a.m.?", "\"I was driving around looking for {V}. I went to my uncle's land because {V} liked it. I found nothing.\""), .direct("What about the tarp and fence posts?", "\"I bought them for a fence project. It is on the receipt. I did not use them for anything else.\""), .cross("You doubled the policy two weeks before, didn't you?", "\"Yes. I did. It was ordinary planning, and I understand how it looks.\""), .cross("You searched about pond depth that week, didn't you?", "\"Yes. I did. It was for a project, and I did not think about the connection.\""), .cross("Your truck was on the farm lane at 4 a.m., wasn't it?", "\"Yes. I was searching. I know it is the wrong place to be searching, and I cannot explain it better.\""), .cross("Remains were found in a pond on your uncle's land, weren't they?", "\"Yes. I cannot explain how remains came to be there, and I never took anyone to that pond.\""), .cross("You bought a tarp and six fence posts the day before, didn't you?", "\"Yes. I did. They were for a fence, and I still have the receipt.\"")],
