        theory: ("{D} used a stolen employee code to cut prices.", "A customer handed a code by a friend."),
        allocution: "\"I'm sorry. I'll repay the store.\"",
        truths: ("{DL} resold most of the tools online.", "The friend later admitted texting {DL} the code with the note 'everybody uses it.'"),
        defendant: [.direct("Tell us about the code.", "\"A friend who works at the store gave me the code as a gift. The friend said everybody uses it, and I believed that.\""), .direct("Why did you use it so often?", "\"It saved money on tools. I buy and sell tools, and I did not think about whether it was allowed.\""), .direct("Did you know it was an employee-only code?", "\"No. I did not know. I thought it was a general promotion that the friend shared.\""), .direct("Why did you resell the tools?", "\"I do that for extra income. I resold most of them online. I did not hide it.\""), .direct("What did you do when the store contacted you?", "\"I showed the friend's text and told them everything. I did not hide anything.\""), .direct("How are you coping with what happened?", "\"Foolish, more than anything. I did not mean to cheat the store. More questions up front would have spared everyone this.\""), .cross("You used the code 31 times, didn't you?", "\"Yes. I did. I know it is a lot, and I know it looks bad.\""), .cross("You typed it at the terminal yourself, didn't you?", "\"Yes. I did. I thought it was fine.\""), .cross("You are not an employee, are you?", "\"No. I am not. I did not know the code was restricted.\""), .cross("You resold most of the tools online, didn't you?", "\"Yes. I did. It is part of my side business.\""), .cross("The friend told you everybody uses it, didn't the friend?", "\"Yes. That is what the text says. I trusted the friend.\"")],
        openings: ("A home improvement store found that an employee-only discount code had been used 31 times over three weeks, taking $1,900 off tool purchases. All of the sales were tied to {D}'s loyalty number and phone, and {D} resold most of the tools online.", "The defense will present a code given as a gift by a friend who works at the store, a text that said everybody uses it, and a person who did not know it was restricted. {D} did not mean to defraud the store."),
