        defendant: [.direct("Describe your dog for the jury.", "\"I love my shepherd mix. I leave the dog in a crate in the garage when I work, with a fan and water.\""), .direct("What did you leave that morning?", "\"A fan on a timer and a full water bottle clipped to the crate. I checked both before I left.\""), .direct("What happened to the fan?", "\"The electric company logged an outage on my street at 10:40 that stopped the fan. I did not know.\""), .direct("Why was the water empty?", "\"The dog may have drunk it all in the heat. I did not realize the fan had stopped.\""), .direct("How long do you leave the dog?", "\"About ten hours on weekdays. I thought it was safe, and I did not think the heat would be so bad.\""), .direct("How are you coping with what happened?", "\"Honestly, I feel awful. My dog suffered because of my plan. I will never leave the dog in the garage in hot weather.\""), .cross("The air was 104 degrees in the garage, wasn't it?", "\"That is what deputies measured. I did not know it would be that hot.\""), .cross("You were at work, weren't you?", "\"Yes. I was. I did not know the power was out.\""), .cross("The dog was left for ten hours most weekdays, wasn't it?", "\"Yes. That is true. I know it is a long time.\""), .cross("The bottle was empty, wasn't it?", "\"Yes. It was empty when officers arrived. I do not know when it ran dry.\""), .cross("The dog had a body temperature of 106, didn't it?", "\"Yes. I know. I am grateful the dog recovered.\"")],
