        defendant: [.direct("Tell the jury about your morning.", "\"I picked up my revolver from a gunsmith at 9:15. It had been repaired, and I put it in my tote bag.\""), .direct("Why did you bring it to the courthouse?", "\"I forgot it was in the bag. I had errands that morning, and I went straight to traffic court.\""), .direct("Why did you put the bag on the belt?", "\"Because everyone does. I had nothing to hide, and I would have left it in the car if I had remembered.\""), .direct("Do you have a permit?", "\"No. I do not have a concealed handgun permit. I know I should have one if I carry it.\""), .direct("What did you tell your family about carrying it?", "\"I texted that I carry it everywhere now. I meant at home and in my truck. I did not mean into a courthouse.\""), .direct("Looking back, how do you feel about it?", "\"The word for it is embarrassed. I should have checked my bag. I did not mean to bring a gun into a courthouse.\""), .cross("You texted that you carry it everywhere now, didn't you?", "\"Yes. I did. I know how that reads in this case.\""), .cross("The revolver was in your tote bag, wasn't it?", "\"Yes. It was. I forgot it was there.\""), .cross("You picked it up at 9:15 that morning, didn't you?", "\"Yes. The receipt shows it. That is when I put it in the bag.\""), .cross("You walked into a courthouse with a revolver, didn't you?", "\"Yes. I did. I did not intend to, and I know it does not matter.\""), .cross("You texted a family member that you carry it everywhere now, didn't you?", "\"I did. I meant it as a joke, and I did not carry it that morning on purpose. I forgot it was in the bag.\"")],
