        openings: ("A dugout, scoreboard wiring, and a fence at a town ballfield were spray-painted and cut overnight on {DATE}. A field camera showed a hooded figure in bright orange sneakers, and paint on {D}'s shoes matched the paint at the field.", "The defense will present paint from a friend's fence, orange sneakers that many people wear, and another teen who later confessed and was found with matching cans. {D} did not do it."),
        closings: ("A hooded figure in orange sneakers, paint on {D}'s shoes that matches, and a photo of {D} holding a spray can that night. The town paid for the repairs.", "Paint from a friend's fence, a common pair of sneakers, and another teen who confessed and was found with matching cans. The State has not proved that {D} damaged the field."),
        timeline: [(0, "11:30 p.m.: a figure enters the field."), (0, "12:15 a.m.: the figure leaves."), (0, "7 a.m.: the groundskeeper finds the damage.")],
